1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
Subs by Mkrm

2
00:01:26,720 --> 00:01:28,860
See? You were all fooled by him.

3
00:01:30,280 --> 00:01:32,700
I was just kidding.

4
00:01:33,640 --> 00:01:36,060
Oh, so you’re calling me a Witch?

5
00:01:36,520 --> 00:01:37,470
Why don't I show you

6
00:01:37,480 --> 00:01:38,940
what a real Witch is.

7
00:01:39,400 --> 00:01:40,860
We’ve been waiting for you forever.

8
00:01:41,400 --> 00:01:42,780
Do you really think

9
00:01:43,240 --> 00:01:47,100
your Jianghai Teammates will actually thank you for this?

10
00:01:47,360 --> 00:01:49,500
What? Teddy is transferring to Saint Qiao High School?!

11
00:01:49,960 --> 00:01:52,350
Why didn't we hear anything about this beforehand?!

12
00:01:52,360 --> 00:01:53,340
Explain yourself to everyone!

13
00:01:53,800 --> 00:01:54,750
You joining the Saint Qiao Team,

14
00:01:54,760 --> 00:01:56,670
makes you an enemy of the Jianghai Team!

15
00:01:56,680 --> 00:01:57,630
You're a Traitor!

16
00:01:57,640 --> 00:01:58,620
How's the situation?

17
00:01:59,080 --> 00:02:01,690
Everything is completely under my control.

18
00:02:05,500 --> 00:02:08,500
Episode 37

19
00:02:08,860 --> 00:02:11,100
Then let’s go, Buzz cut.

20
00:04:15,880 --> 00:04:16,860
Phantom Shockwave

21
00:04:44,000 --> 00:04:44,700
How was that?

22
00:04:45,640 --> 00:04:47,100
Make sure to control your emotions.

23
00:04:47,840 --> 00:04:49,500
And don't be too sad when you lose!

24
00:04:50,920 --> 00:04:54,300
I’m leaving now. Take care.

25
00:04:56,080 --> 00:04:59,100
What a reckless, brainless fool.

26
00:05:02,920 --> 00:05:05,820
Linda, that was a beautiful performance!

27
00:05:06,760 --> 00:05:09,180
Next time, this kind of embarrassing stuff,

28
00:05:10,300 --> 00:05:11,580
take care of it yourself!

29
00:05:17,120 --> 00:05:18,780
The capable should do more work.

30
00:05:26,720 --> 00:05:27,900
How can it be like this?

31
00:05:30,280 --> 00:05:31,260
It is very sudden.

32
00:05:33,240 --> 00:05:36,060
But I can understand Teddy’s thoughts.

33
00:05:37,760 --> 00:05:39,900
After all, none of us can leave Yo-Yo behind.

34
00:05:44,680 --> 00:05:45,660
Although Teddy’s departure,

35
00:05:47,080 --> 00:05:48,060
and even the leaked Signature Moves

36
00:05:48,520 --> 00:05:50,940
make it tough for Jianghai Team to win the Championship,

37
00:05:53,320 --> 00:05:55,260
I hope we can still be friends in the future.

38
00:05:57,160 --> 00:05:59,580
After all, our past friendship remains.

39
00:06:02,920 --> 00:06:05,820
Leo, I’m glad you think that way.

40
00:06:07,420 --> 00:06:09,180
The purpose of Yo-Yo is

41
00:06:09,340 --> 00:06:10,760
to constantly break through your limits,

42
00:06:11,840 --> 00:06:13,980
improve your skills, and strengthen Friendships.

43
00:06:14,920 --> 00:06:17,820
These are far, far more important

44
00:06:18,080 --> 00:06:19,260
than winning or losing a Competition.

45
00:06:20,200 --> 00:06:21,430
You haven’t been Captain for nothing.

46
00:06:23,560 --> 00:06:25,980
Mark, Matthew and the others are in a really bad mood,

47
00:06:27,380 --> 00:06:28,860
I’m afraid it’ll affect their Performance.

48
00:06:29,500 --> 00:06:31,440
I plan to talk with them again.

49
00:06:33,820 --> 00:06:34,620
Go ahead.

50
00:06:35,260 --> 00:06:37,980
Right now, the Jianghai Team needs
you as their Captain more than ever.

51
00:06:41,320 --> 00:06:42,780
We’ve already verified.

52
00:06:43,720 --> 00:06:44,700
The Jianghai Team’s Signature Moves

53
00:06:45,160 --> 00:06:48,060
are exactly as Teddy’s Intel described.

54
00:06:49,480 --> 00:06:51,420
Unless they change their Moves now,

55
00:06:52,360 --> 00:06:56,700
they have no choice but to surrender.

56
00:06:58,120 --> 00:07:01,500
Hmph, the Jianghai Team has no way out now.

57
00:07:02,920 --> 00:07:04,860
Even if they want to change Moves,

58
00:07:05,320 --> 00:07:06,780
there’s no time left.

59
00:07:08,380 --> 00:07:09,660
Only 1 week left.

60
00:07:10,600 --> 00:07:13,980
The Blazing Teens Yo-Yo Tournament is about to start.

61
00:07:15,880 --> 00:07:18,300
Then their only option is to lose.

62
00:07:19,240 --> 00:07:21,180
There's no way they can win.

63
00:07:21,340 --> 00:07:25,980
Of course not, unless the sun rises from the west.

64
00:07:29,320 --> 00:07:33,660
Hmph, I believe that on this entire Planet,

65
00:07:35,080 --> 00:07:36,730
no one is capable of pulling that off!

66
00:07:43,420 --> 00:07:44,220
You’re right.

67
00:07:44,680 --> 00:07:46,620
I was a bit too harsh with Teddy.

68
00:07:47,740 --> 00:07:49,020
But the facts are right in front of us.

69
00:07:49,660 --> 00:07:51,900
Teddy knows at least 4 of our Signature Moves.

70
00:07:53,500 --> 00:07:54,300
Michael and his Team

71
00:07:54,760 --> 00:07:56,700
will definitely use Counter-Moves accordingly.

72
00:07:58,600 --> 00:08:00,060
If we lose these 4 Matches,

73
00:08:01,480 --> 00:08:02,940
winning the Championship is nearly impossible.

74
00:08:05,020 --> 00:08:07,390
Then all of our hard work over
the last 6 months will be wasted.

75
00:08:08,860 --> 00:08:09,960
It’s all Matthew’s fault.

76
00:08:10,120 --> 00:08:11,580
He didn’t leave any room for compromise.

77
00:08:12,040 --> 00:08:13,500
Now Teddy will definitely tell them.

78
00:08:14,440 --> 00:08:15,900
Why do you blame me for everything?

79
00:08:16,840 --> 00:08:18,780
Did you expect me to be polite to him?

80
00:08:21,160 --> 00:08:22,620
You guys were too impulsive.

81
00:08:23,080 --> 00:08:24,330
Hmph, I haven’t cursed him enough.

82
00:08:25,180 --> 00:08:27,420
Matthew, you need to go find Teddy and bring him back.

83
00:08:27,680 --> 00:08:28,790
so I can scold him properly.

84
00:08:29,320 --> 00:08:31,260
Hmph, What’s the use of scolding now?

85
00:08:32,680 --> 00:08:34,620
Scolding Teddy won’t solve anything.

86
00:08:36,040 --> 00:08:37,500
Besides, what Teddy did...

87
00:08:37,960 --> 00:08:38,760
he must have his own difficulties.

88
00:08:40,360 --> 00:08:41,340
We need to act quickly.

89
00:08:41,500 --> 00:08:43,140
We need to find a way to change our Moves.

90
00:08:43,720 --> 00:08:44,700
Right, right.

91
00:08:45,160 --> 00:08:47,550
We should rescue the dying,
heal the wounded, and cure people.

92
00:08:48,520 --> 00:08:50,500
I think you first need to cure yourself.

93
00:08:52,060 --> 00:08:53,340
Only a few days until the Tournament.

94
00:08:53,800 --> 00:08:55,260
Even if we can come up with new Moves,

95
00:08:55,520 --> 00:08:56,220
there’s no time to practice them.

96
00:08:57,160 --> 00:09:00,060
Exactly. I’ve even lost weight practicing my Signature Move.

97
00:09:00,520 --> 00:09:02,940
Do you think changing it is that easy?

98
00:09:03,880 --> 00:09:04,830
Everyone, let's try to think

99
00:09:04,840 --> 00:09:06,300
of a practical solution.

100
00:09:13,480 --> 00:09:14,940
Hey, I have an idea!

101
00:09:15,400 --> 00:09:16,380
What!

102
00:09:16,440 --> 00:09:18,780
We'll just say the entire Jianghai Team has diarrhea.

103
00:09:19,040 --> 00:09:20,700
And we'll wait until the next Tournament to Compete!

104
00:09:21,340 --> 00:09:22,620
Chuck, what did you say?

105
00:09:23,080 --> 00:09:24,540
Chuck, are you asking for a beating?

106
00:09:25,180 --> 00:09:26,940
Hehe, I just saw how tense the atmosphere was,

107
00:09:27,400 --> 00:09:28,380
so I was just making a joke!

108
00:09:30,760 --> 00:09:32,220
Hey, I have an idea too.

109
00:09:32,680 --> 00:09:33,180
Say it.

110
00:09:34,020 --> 00:09:35,100
Better not suggest Jianghai Team

111
00:09:35,360 --> 00:09:36,650
forfeiting as a Team or something.

112
00:09:37,760 --> 00:09:38,940
What do you take me for?

113
00:09:39,200 --> 00:09:40,860
How could I suggest such a dumb idea?

114
00:09:41,400 --> 00:09:42,300
I meant to say

115
00:09:42,760 --> 00:09:44,190
Michael and them are definitely
preparing based on

116
00:09:44,200 --> 00:09:45,660
our latest new Signature Moves.

117
00:09:46,500 --> 00:09:48,060
Why don’t we use our old Signature Moves?

118
00:09:49,000 --> 00:09:50,460
That way they’ll be caught off guard.

119
00:09:51,680 --> 00:09:52,380
What do you think?

120
00:09:52,540 --> 00:09:54,300
No one thought of this idea, right?

121
00:09:57,060 --> 00:09:58,140
What, do you all agree?

122
00:10:00,040 --> 00:10:01,980
What a great idea!

123
00:10:02,420 --> 00:10:03,420
Why?

124
00:10:03,880 --> 00:10:04,380
Think about it.

125
00:10:05,600 --> 00:10:07,260
The latest Signature Moves have already leaked.

126
00:10:07,720 --> 00:10:10,140
Michael definitely knows our old Signature Moves too.

127
00:10:11,560 --> 00:10:13,500
Then the Jianghai Team is hopeless.

128
00:10:16,360 --> 00:10:18,780
Leo, so what’s your plan?

129
00:10:21,340 --> 00:10:22,370
I do have one idea.

130
00:10:23,360 --> 00:10:24,060
What's the plan?

131
00:10:25,960 --> 00:10:27,900
But it'll require everyone's hard work.

132
00:10:28,360 --> 00:10:30,300
No problem. As long as we can save the Jianghai Team,

133
00:10:30,760 --> 00:10:31,740
we'll do anything!

134
00:10:46,600 --> 00:10:48,100
Swap Signature Moves?

135
00:10:50,240 --> 00:10:51,420
Will that work?

136
00:10:54,760 --> 00:10:55,740
I think it'll work.

137
00:10:56,380 --> 00:10:58,500
This is way better than creating
new Signature Moves from scratch.

138
00:11:00,040 --> 00:11:00,990
Great idea.

139
00:11:01,000 --> 00:11:03,130
Now the Jianghai Team has hope.
-I agree.

140
00:11:03,880 --> 00:11:04,380
I agree too.

141
00:11:05,320 --> 00:11:06,780
We have no problem either.

142
00:11:07,240 --> 00:11:09,610
Alright. Starting tomorrow, we'll meet at the River.

143
00:11:10,300 --> 00:11:11,770
and start Training again.

144
00:11:12,520 --> 00:11:13,570
Shawn, you're joining too.

145
00:11:15,880 --> 00:11:16,860
Ah! You're letting me join too?

146
00:11:19,240 --> 00:11:21,980
The moment I've been dreaming of has finally arrived.

147
00:11:24,520 --> 00:11:25,900
What? Shawn is joining?

148
00:11:26,920 --> 00:11:28,860
Leo, You're not really going to let him Compete, are you?

149
00:11:31,520 --> 00:11:33,180
Shawn's Yo-Yo skills have improved significantly.

150
00:11:34,120 --> 00:11:35,330
I plan to have him as our Substitute.

151
00:11:37,480 --> 00:11:39,200
Teddy is gone, someone has to step up, right?

152
00:11:40,360 --> 00:11:41,990
Matthew, You help Shawn practice some more.

153
00:11:43,040 --> 00:11:43,740
No problem.

154
00:11:44,380 --> 00:11:46,620
He's long mastered the 30 Basic Moves.

155
00:11:47,560 --> 00:11:48,540
I even have my own original Signature Moves!

156
00:11:49,480 --> 00:11:50,940
It's not 'Steal the Sky and Swap the Sun' again, is it?

157
00:11:51,680 --> 00:11:52,380
Exactly!

158
00:11:55,720 --> 00:11:57,180
Alright, this is the final moment.

159
00:11:57,640 --> 00:11:58,620
We need to work as one.

160
00:11:59,080 --> 00:12:00,540
Remember the Jianghai Team's slogan?

161
00:12:03,880 --> 00:12:06,300
Jianghai Team, Victory is ours! Yeah!

162
00:12:07,720 --> 00:12:11,100
Shhh, you're too loud. The neighbors will complain.

163
00:12:18,460 --> 00:12:19,260
Leo, Mark.

164
00:12:21,640 --> 00:12:22,620
You're here.

165
00:12:27,880 --> 00:12:28,830
Sis, hurry up!

166
00:12:28,840 --> 00:12:29,820
Look, they're already here.

167
00:12:31,240 --> 00:12:32,220
Shawn, hurry!

168
00:12:32,680 --> 00:12:33,660
Jianghai Team, fall in!

169
00:12:37,960 --> 00:12:38,940
Face forward!

170
00:12:39,580 --> 00:12:40,380
Count off!

171
00:12:40,390 --> 00:12:42,780
1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7!

172
00:14:57,640 --> 00:15:02,460
Sliding up, sliding down, one pull and one release.

173
00:15:03,400 --> 00:15:05,820
Back and forth, the tricks change endlessly.

174
00:15:06,280 --> 00:15:08,220
It's really not easy.

175
00:15:09,160 --> 00:15:13,980
An eternal sport, full of wisdom and meaning.

176
00:15:14,920 --> 00:15:17,340
Between each rise and fall, speed and power combine.

177
00:15:17,800 --> 00:15:20,190
Training body and mind.

178
00:15:20,200 --> 00:15:25,500
High and low, rise and fall, a timeless law.

179
00:15:25,960 --> 00:15:31,740
Spinning round and round, never stopping,
let life's fire shine.

180
00:15:32,200 --> 00:15:34,590
A flame burns inside my heart, burning away all doubt.

181
00:15:34,600 --> 00:15:35,070
burning away all doubt.

182
00:15:35,080 --> 00:15:37,470
A flame burns inside my heart,
burning away the confusion.

183
00:15:37,480 --> 00:15:38,940
Blazing heat is energy.

184
00:15:40,360 --> 00:15:43,260
Steel forged through countless
hammer blows must be refined.

185
00:15:43,720 --> 00:15:49,020
A fire burning in my heart,
breaking through fearlessly.

186
00:15:49,480 --> 00:15:52,860
Ever improving. Growth demands breakthroughs.

187
00:15:53,320 --> 00:15:57,180
My youth is mine to command.

188
00:16:10,600 --> 00:16:15,420
The Yo-Yo spins, the fun is infinite.

189
00:16:16,360 --> 00:16:19,230
Facing every challenge, overcoming each obstacle.

190
00:16:19,240 --> 00:16:21,660
I'll take the test.

191
00:16:22,120 --> 00:16:26,940
My firm belief will never waver.

192
00:16:27,880 --> 00:16:33,180
Without real battles, without tasting failure,
how can we move ahead?

193
00:16:33,640 --> 00:16:38,940
Highs and lows, rise and fall,
that's the eternal law.

194
00:16:39,400 --> 00:16:44,700
Spinning round and round, never stopping,
let life's fire shine.

195
00:16:45,160 --> 00:16:50,460
A flame burning in my heart,
burning away all doubt.

196
00:16:50,920 --> 00:16:56,220
Blazing heat is energy. Steel forged
a thousand times must be refined.

197
00:16:56,680 --> 00:17:01,980
A fire burning in my heart,
breaking through without fear.

198
00:17:02,440 --> 00:17:06,300
Always improving, growing demands breakthroughs.

199
00:17:06,760 --> 00:17:10,620
My youth is mine to command.

200
00:17:32,200 --> 00:17:32,700
Teddy.

201
00:17:50,240 --> 00:17:53,340
Why did you guys come looking for me?

202
00:17:55,240 --> 00:17:57,020
We wanted to talk with you.

203
00:18:02,440 --> 00:18:02,940
Teddy.

204
00:18:03,880 --> 00:18:04,860
Remember...

205
00:18:05,500 --> 00:18:07,740
That morning we left Falcon Base?

206
00:18:09,640 --> 00:18:13,020
I still remember that moment to this day.

207
00:18:14,920 --> 00:18:15,900
I know.

208
00:18:16,640 --> 00:18:19,740
Deep down, you never wanted to leave the Jianghai Team.

209
00:18:23,260 --> 00:18:27,420
Today, Matthew and I came to tell you

210
00:18:30,080 --> 00:18:32,230
even if you win the Championship for Saint Qiao Team,

211
00:18:34,300 --> 00:18:35,100
we won't hold it against you.

212
00:18:37,480 --> 00:18:41,820
Because you poured your sweat into the Jianghai Team.

213
00:18:42,760 --> 00:18:44,220
That's also for the Jianghai Team's honor.

214
00:18:46,600 --> 00:18:49,020
Mark, Matthew.

215
00:18:50,720 --> 00:18:54,300
I was so angry at the time...
I leaked all your Signature Moves...

216
00:18:54,460 --> 00:18:56,220
Teddy, stop.

217
00:18:57,820 --> 00:18:58,620
Leo's right.

218
00:19:00,040 --> 00:19:01,980
Since Yo-Yos are what made us friends...

219
00:19:03,400 --> 00:19:05,430
then our Friendship should be
able to withstand any test.

220
00:19:06,760 --> 00:19:10,140
I've got a bad temper. Don't be mad.

221
00:19:14,620 --> 00:19:15,420
It's fine.

222
00:19:17,120 --> 00:19:18,780
What will the Team think of me?

223
00:19:21,160 --> 00:19:23,100
Everyone already understands you.

224
00:19:25,480 --> 00:19:29,340
I... I am going to leave the Saint Qiao Team.

225
00:19:30,760 --> 00:19:33,660
Teddy, that's not like a Jianghai Team Member.

226
00:19:35,560 --> 00:19:37,500
The Competition is very important.

227
00:19:38,920 --> 00:19:40,860
but our Friendship is even more important.

228
00:19:41,500 --> 00:19:43,260
Exactly! If you compete...

229
00:19:43,900 --> 00:19:45,150
we'll just pretend it's the Jianghai Team...

230
00:19:45,160 --> 00:19:46,620
Training together! Right?

231
00:19:48,520 --> 00:19:51,900
Teddy, tomorrow's the Big Tournament.

232
00:19:52,840 --> 00:19:53,820
If you compete,

233
00:19:54,760 --> 00:19:55,740
you should show all your Skills.

234
00:19:57,160 --> 00:19:58,140
Don't let the Jianghai Team down.

235
00:19:59,560 --> 00:20:01,980
I'll remember... Captain.

236
00:20:03,400 --> 00:20:04,380
I haven't been Captain for a long time.

237
00:20:06,280 --> 00:20:09,180
In my heart, you'll always be my Captain.

238
00:20:24,020 --> 00:20:26,460
Grandpa, everyone has been practicing
their Signature Moves lately.

239
00:20:27,400 --> 00:20:28,380
You were a huge help to me.

240
00:20:29,320 --> 00:20:32,220
No way, it's all your own hard work.

241
00:20:32,680 --> 00:20:35,100
I don't know a thing about Yo-Yo.

242
00:20:36,700 --> 00:20:38,940
But you told us about your Diabolo experience.

243
00:20:39,880 --> 00:20:41,340
That was really inspiring for everyone.

244
00:20:42,280 --> 00:20:44,220
Looks like my Diabolo practice paid off.

245
00:20:45,640 --> 00:20:49,020
How's your Ultimate Holy Light training going?

246
00:20:49,480 --> 00:20:50,430
You know about that too?

247
00:20:50,440 --> 00:20:52,380
Hey, who do you think I am?

248
00:20:53,800 --> 00:20:55,260
How could I not know about my own kid?

249
00:20:56,200 --> 00:20:58,620
Grandpa, you once told me

250
00:20:59,080 --> 00:21:02,940
to "Learn. Master. Refine. Perfect. Transcend."

251
00:21:05,600 --> 00:21:07,740
I feel like I'm still very far away from that.

252
00:21:09,160 --> 00:21:10,620
Take your time, kid.

253
00:21:11,360 --> 00:21:13,500
You've still got a long road ahead.

254
00:21:14,440 --> 00:21:17,820
Some things take a lifetime to accomplish.

255
00:21:21,640 --> 00:21:23,580
Grandpa, I understand it now.

256
00:21:24,000 --> 00:21:25,000
Back then,

257
00:21:25,000 --> 00:21:28,000
Why you didn't come to the
Exhibition Match at the Falcon Base?

